<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.4200 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.4200 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.4200 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Wednesday after 75.4949 on Tuesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     June 25		 June 24</p>
<p> High			     75.4500		 75.4999</p>
<p> Low				75.4000		 75.4000</p>
<p> Open			     75.4000		 75.4000</p>
<p> Close			    75.4200		 75.4949</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)		  1.150		   1.220</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
